{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1369038-anyone-else-really-eager-for-distant-worlds","id":1369038,"title":"Anyone else really eager for Distant Worlds?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-19T16:00:51-08:00","id":1369038,"title":"Anyone else really eager for Distant Worlds?","content":"Because I am. I'm honestly hoping for something that while sticking to Trinity's rather optimistic view, takes <br /> some of the feeling we got from Gatecrasher for Eclipse <br /> Phaset<br /> --that the universe is mysterious and <i>old</i><br /> \u200b and both majesty and horror can be found in the Dark. My biggest hope is that we see some &quot;real weirdie&quot; examples of tech produced by the various vanished societies out there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-19T16:14:13-08:00","id":1369044,"title":"","content":"By the way they did the chromatics, Qin and Coalision, I believe the other aliens will be interesting...<br /> <br /> The art so far is beautiful!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-20T10:08:10-08:00","id":1369149,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to it, but I think I'm actually more eager for <i>Terra Firma</i> and some good, in-depth stuff in terms of Earth itself. I'm especially hoping for some details on the Nippon arcology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-01T06:29:20-08:00","id":1372143,"title":"","content":"I think I can safely (in NDA terms) say that there is some first-rate work in both of these books. I also got to drop a tiny bit of my Legions worldbuilding/headcanon into one of the Distant Worlds' new planets, and to do a little bit of expanding on the Upeo through Ruan's World. I'm eager to see the final published versions, and a little bit angsty that other commitments prevented me from taking any word count on <b>[REDACTED]</b>.<br /> <br /> - C.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Clayton A. Oliver | Formerly Ubiquitous<br /> <br /> <i>When the half-light starts to rise/And the long gone come back again<br /> After the shortcuts and the highs/Comes the pain<br /> And the rain</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2966-tegyrius","name":"Tegyrius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2966_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-01T06:54:31-08:00","id":1372146,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m looking forward to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-02T11:26:31-08:00","id":1372309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tegyrius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1369038-anyone-else-really-eager-for-distant-worlds?p=1372143#post1372143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I can safely (in NDA terms) say that there is some first-rate work in both of these books. I also got to drop a tiny bit of my Legions worldbuilding/headcanon into one of the Distant Worlds' new planets, and to do a little bit of expanding on the Upeo through Ruan's World. I'm eager to see the final published versions, and a little bit angsty that other commitments prevented me from taking any word count on <b>[REDACTED]</b>.<br /> <br /> - C.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tease... TEASE!!<br /> <br /> But all joking aside, is I'm looking forward to it, and it's on my &quot;oh, it's out? BUY BUTTON!&quot; list.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-02T17:32:28-08:00","id":1372355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tegyrius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1369038-anyone-else-really-eager-for-distant-worlds?p=1372143#post1372143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I also got to drop a tiny bit of my Legions worldbuilding/headcanon into one of the Distant Worlds' new planets</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this the biotech gun that shoots little miniature attack dogs, and when the dogs bark, swarms of nanite bees shoot out of their mouths and attack the target with little lightsaber-stingers? And will it have attachment options like chainsaw bayonet or shark-launcher? <br /> <br /> More seriously, I am already looking forward to all Aeon stuff; This just makes me want Distant Worlds more. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"useri